  "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><h2 data-lake-id=\"Q598y\" id=\"Q598y\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua10266f6\" id=\"ua10266f6\"> 什么是ADC模数转换？</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"ud65bdee9\" id=\"ud65bdee9\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua41b37b9\" id=\"ua41b37b9\">想象你在一个音乐会上，音乐声音时大时小。你用耳朵听到这些声音，能感受到声音大小的变化。这些声音是</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ued4c7eec\" id=\"ued4c7eec\">连续变化的</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ub9561368\" id=\"ub9561368\">，就像水流一样，随时可能变大或变小。这种连续变化的东西就叫</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ud0a640a4\" id=\"ud0a640a4\">模拟信号</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ufa3088de\" id=\"ufa3088de\">。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u96ae5719\" id=\"u96ae5719\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue4988152\" id=\"ue4988152\">但是，电脑和机器人不像我们，他们不能“听”到这些声音。他们只能看懂</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uf9e114ee\" id=\"uf9e114ee\">数字</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ub789f291\" id=\"ub789f291\">，比如0、1、2、3这些数字。**ADC（模数转换器）**就是一种工具，它能把这种连续变化的声音（模拟信号）变成一组电脑能看懂的数字。这就是模数转换的工作。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ubca383df\" id=\"ubca383df\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ubfee1b07\" id=\"ubfee1b07\">​</span></strong><br></p><h4 data-lake-id=\"lkuXe\" id=\"lkuXe\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7d391545\" id=\"u7d391545\">1.1. 举个简单的例子</span></h4><p data-lake-id=\"uf54e1903\" id=\"uf54e1903\"><span data-lake-id=\"u545e5f61\" id=\"u545e5f61\">你知道温度计是用来测温度的，对吧？温度计上的水银柱或者电子温度计的指针会随温度升高而变化，显示出不同的温度。这个温度的变化就像我们刚才说的声音变化，是</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u4dbc7b85\" id=\"u4dbc7b85\">连续的模拟信号</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u11a20cd1\" id=\"u11a20cd1\">。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u5cd0a1d2\" id=\"u5cd0a1d2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6c52239d\" id=\"u6c52239d\">但是，如果你想让电脑知道现在的温度是多少，它是看不懂水银柱的。这里就需要用到</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uf9962f32\" id=\"uf9962f32\">ADC模数转换器</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u624d6aa2\" id=\"u624d6aa2\">，把温度变成数字，比如“20°C”、“30°C”，这样电脑就能理解了。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"uc3455676\" id=\"uc3455676\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u3caee032\" id=\"u3caee032\">​</span></strong><br></p><h4 data-lake-id=\"KGbNy\" id=\"KGbNy\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5f8a8427\" id=\"u5f8a8427\">1.2. 更简单的解释</span></h4><ul list=\"u63a3189e\"><li fid=\"ua86e16d8\" data-lake-id=\"u9cb77fe5\" id=\"u9cb77fe5\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u4bb77840\" id=\"u4bb77840\">模拟信号</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u997b76be\" id=\"u997b76be\">就像是温度或声音的变化，它们是连续的、没有固定的点。</span></li><li fid=\"ua86e16d8\" data-lake-id=\"u561bae6c\" id=\"u561bae6c\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uad67b9b3\" id=\"uad67b9b3\">数字信号</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u03e69de0\" id=\"u03e69de0\">就像数数：1、2、3……每一个数字是固定的，电脑和机器只能理解这些数字。</span></li><li fid=\"ua86e16d8\" data-lake-id=\"u1850f58e\" id=\"u1850f58e\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u88f0efc6\" id=\"u88f0efc6\">ADC模数转换</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"uef3c6bca\" id=\"uef3c6bca\">就是帮我们把连续的变化（比如温度或声音）变成可以数出来的数字。</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id=\"u62f3704e\" id=\"u62f3704e\"><span data-lake-id=\"uddcf67da\" id=\"uddcf67da\">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u0f31fa54\" id=\"u0f31fa54\"><span data-lake-id=\"u90035b6d\" id=\"u90035b6d\">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u9ff4d5a9\" id=\"u9ff4d5a9\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3e800b76\" id=\"u3e800b76\">创建ADC测量对象</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22from%20machine%20import%20Pin%2CADC%5Cn%23%20%E5%B9%B6%E8%AE%BE%E7%BD%AE%E6%B5%8B%E9%87%8F%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4%5Cnadc%20%3D%20ADC(1%2Catten%3DADC.ATTN_11DB)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22g9ygB%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"ud9cac43b\" id=\"ud9cac43b\"><span data-lake-id=\"u96eeb259\" id=\"u96eeb259\" style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38)\">在读取高于参考电压的电压时，可以使用 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u73394e16\" id=\"u73394e16\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc1b3654f\" id=\"uc1b3654f\" class=\"lake-fontsize-10\" style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38)\">atten</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u5bfb6094\" id=\"u5bfb6094\" style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38)\"> 参数来应用输入衰减。设置衰减等级不仅是为了限定测量范围，还涉及到保护设备、提高测量精度和适应不同信号特性等多个方面。</span></p><ul list=\"u41408631\"><li fid=\"u4b5096d7\" data-lake-id=\"uc3f8879c\" id=\"uc3f8879c\"><code data-lake-id=\"ude0ba225\" id=\"ude0ba225\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc736edcd\" id=\"uc736edcd\" class=\"lake-fontsize-9\" style=\"color: rgb(231, 76, 60); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">ADC.ATTN_0DB</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uf1819f6f\" id=\"uf1819f6f\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">: 没有衰减等级，测量范围 (100mV - 950mV)</span></li><li fid=\"u4b5096d7\" data-lake-id=\"ub318c9dd\" id=\"ub318c9dd\"><code data-lake-id=\"u5e9bad48\" id=\"u5e9bad48\"><span data-lake-id=\"u99790fe5\" id=\"u99790fe5\" class=\"lake-fontsize-9\" style=\"color: rgb(231, 76, 60); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">ADC.ATTN_2_5DB</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ue7bc1087\" id=\"ue7bc1087\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">: 2.5dB 衰减等级，测量范围 (100mV - 1250mV)</span></li><li fid=\"u4b5096d7\" data-lake-id=\"u006742fa\" id=\"u006742fa\"><code data-lake-id=\"uaf30ed40\" id=\"uaf30ed40\"><span data-lake-id=\"ucde9795c\" id=\"ucde9795c\" class=\"lake-fontsize-9\" style=\"color: rgb(231, 76, 60); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">ADC.ATTN_6DB</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uea8652eb\" id=\"uea8652eb\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">: 6dB 衰减等级，测量范围 (150mV - 1750mV)</span></li><li fid=\"u4b5096d7\" data-lake-id=\"u56e6a9f7\" id=\"u56e6a9f7\"><code data-lake-id=\"ue51f46f5\" id=\"ue51f46f5\"><span data-lake-id=\"ucf677931\" id=\"ucf677931\" class=\"lake-fontsize-9\" style=\"color: rgb(231, 76, 60); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">ADC.ATTN_11DB</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ua5f2352f\" id=\"ua5f2352f\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">: 11dB 衰减等级，测量范围 (150mV - 2450mV)</span></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id=\"MylAc\" id=\"MylAc\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u511155b8\" id=\"u511155b8\">读取电压值</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u629894b2\" id=\"u629894b2\"><br></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"bEUYl\" id=\"bEUYl\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7d3bfde3\" id=\"u7d3bfde3\">原理</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"uf699b41c\" id=\"uf699b41c\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua960e940\" id=\"ua960e940\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">芯片内部参考电压是3.3v，ADC满量程读取的值为4095，所以我们可以根据我们测量的值进行换算。下面给出了一个参考例程</span></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"XqaER\" id=\"XqaER\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"uef2808e4\" id=\"uef2808e4\">示例代码</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"ufe3d03ea\" id=\"ufe3d03ea\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub02b80bd\" id=\"ub02b80bd\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">接线：1号引脚---2号引脚</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u00f4c2e3\" id=\"u00f4c2e3\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub2893dab\" id=\"ub2893dab\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">原理：1号引脚adc采样2号引脚输出的PWM电压</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22from%20machine%20import%20ADC%2CPin%2CPWM%5Cnimport%20time%5Cn%5Cnadc%20%3D%20ADC(Pin(1)%2Catten%3DADC.ATTN_11DB)%5Cn%5Cnpwm1%20%3D%20PWM(Pin(2)%2C%20freq%3D10000)%5Cnpwm1.duty(512)%5Cn%5Cnwhile%20True%3A%20%20%20%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20samples%20%3D%20%5Badc.read()%20for%20_%20in%20range(100)%5D%5Cn%20%20%20%20avg%20%3D%20sum(samples)%20%2F%20len(samples)%5Cn%20%20%20%20voltage%20%3D%20avg%20*%203.3%20%2F%204095%20%20%23%2012%E4%BD%8D%E8%BD%AC%E7%94%B5%E5%8E%8B%E5%80%BC%5Cn%20%20%20%20print(%5C%22Voltage%3A%20%7B%3A.2f%7DV%5C%22.format(voltage))%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20time.sleep_ms(1000)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Xokfb%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h2 data-lake-id=\"xTaA2\" id=\"xTaA2\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"udbce05c6\" id=\"udbce05c6\">练习：读取热敏电阻温度</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"uf9a5f1c0\" id=\"uf9a5f1c0\"><br></p>",
